Elara sets a clean cup beside the hearth. "Catch your breath. The road can wait."
+ [What does restoration do?]
    "One visit restores all your Health, Mana and Stamina. If Alby defeats you, I will bring you home and tend you for free. Your gold and claimed rewards stay yours."
    -> END
+ [Restore all my resources for 10 gold. # action:heal]
    "There. Steady hands and a clear head. Take care out there."
    -> END
+ [Tell me about the village.]
    "Cross the stream for Nell's bread and Bram's forge. Petra keeps the bank just south of here. Aren watches the northern approach."
    -> END
